    <string name="sync_help">Calendar Clock reads Android’s device calendars. For iCloud or CalDAV, use DAVx⁵. In Outlook, enable Settings → Calendar → Sync calendars. Other apps that populate Android calendars also work.\n\nWi-Fi is only needed for new cloud changes. Cached events and the clock work offline.</string>
