    <string name="about">About and power</string>
    <string name="about_body">A local, read-only calendar display. Only calendar read permission is requested; no account passwords or network access.\n\nThe screen stays awake while this app is in the foreground, including on battery. Exit to restore normal sleep. Pressing the power button stops the live display. Battery life depends on your device.\n\nOn BOOX, unfreeze the clock and sync apps. For the clock, set App optimization → Other → Background activity to “Always run” (wording varies by firmware). Turn off the frontlight manually if desired. Reopen the clock after restarting the device.</string>
